What you have to do, when standing in front of the drawbridge at the
castle, is play your PSR510 (if that is the instrument you've found) with
some set of notes.  Then, if you are wrong, the game will tell you and
then you proceed to play a Mastermind-type game to get the drawbridge
open.  If that doesn't work, try a wand of opening, or go around to the
back (but make sure you have some sort of levitation!) of the castle,
where there should be a door.



